[{"answer":"I've been reading your personal statement, Paul.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"First, let's talk about your work experience in South America.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"What took you there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Was it to gain more fluency in Spanish?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as I'm combining Spanish with Latin American studies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"my main idea was to find out more about the way people lived there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"My spoken Spanish was already pretty good in fact.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/7.mp3"},{"answer":"So you weren't too worried about language barriers?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/9.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I ended up teaching English there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/10.mp3"},{"answer":"although that wasn't my original choice of work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"How did you find out about all this?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I found an agency that runs all kinds of voluntary projects in South America.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"What kind of work?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there were several possibilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean construction? Engineering work?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, getting involved in building projects was an option.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there was tourism - taking tourists for walks around the volcanoes -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"which I actually chose to do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and then there was work with local farmers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"But you didn't continue with that project. Why not?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Because I never really knew whether I'd be needed or not.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd thought it might be difficult physically, but I was certainly fit enough...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"now, I wanted to do something that had more of a proper structure to it, I suppose,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I get demotivated otherwise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think you learned from your experience?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It must have been a great opportunity to examine community life.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but it was difficult at first to be accepted by the locals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a very remote village","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and some of them were reluctant to speak to me -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"although they were always interested in my clothes and how much I'd had to pay for them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's understandable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but things soon improved.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/34.mp3"},{"answer":"What struck me was that when people became more comfortable with me and less suspicious,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/35.mp3"},{"answer":"we really connected with each other in a meaningful way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/36.mp3"},{"answer":"You made good friends?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, with two of the families in particular.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/39.mp3"},{"answer":"What about management.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you have a project manager?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and he gave me lots of advice and guidance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And was he good at managing too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/43.mp3"},{"answer":"That wasn't his strong point!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I think he was often more interested in the academic side of things than filling reports.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/45.mp3"},{"answer":"He was a bit of a dreamer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And did you have a contract?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I had to stay for a minimum of three months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/48.mp3"},{"answer":"My parents were surprised when I asked to stay longer - six months in the end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I was so happy there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And did anything on the administration side of things surprise you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/51.mp3"},{"answer":"What was the food and lodging like?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Simple... but there was plenty to eat and I only paid $7 a day for that, which was amazing really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And they gave me all the equipment I needed... even a laptop.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/54.mp3"},{"answer":"You didn't expect that then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/55.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'll look forward to hearing more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/57.mp3"},{"answer":"But now let's look at these modules.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/58.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll need to start thinking about which ones you'll definitely want to study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/59.mp3"},{"answer":"The first one here is Gender Studies in Latin America.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It looks at how gender analysis is reconfiguring civil society in Latin America.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Women are increasingly occupying positions in government","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and in other elected leadership positions in Latin America.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I think you'd find it interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/64.mp3"},{"answer":"If it was to do with people in the villages rather than those in the public sphere, I would.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/66.mp3"},{"answer":"What about Second Language Acquisition?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think I'd find that useful?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you've had some practical experience in the field, I think it would be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I hadn't thought about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll put that down as a definite, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/72.mp3"},{"answer":"What about indigenous Women's Lives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/73.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds appropriate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought so too, but I looked at last year's exam questions and that changed my mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't judge the value of the course on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe talk to some other students first and we can talk about it again later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and lastly, will you sign up for Portuguese lessons?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/79.mp3"},{"answer":"My Spanish is good, so would I find that module easy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Not necessarily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people find that Spanish interferes with learning Portuguese...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/82.mp3"},{"answer":"getting the accent right too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/83.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite different in a lot of ways.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'd much sooner do something else, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Alright.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what we need to do...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-8-test-3-part-3-2023-07-26-16-45-46/87.mp3"}]
